## 5. Desktop embedding of Vigil Web (same carbon UI)

- ✅ Desktop **Account** login (Firebase Auth email/password) — Settings → Account  
- ✅ Best-effort **plan + chat sync to Firestore** when signed in (`persistActive` / `persistTab`)  
- ✅ Pull chats from cloud → VigilDB (Account button + auto after sign-in)  
- 🟨 Fallback native history merges cloud chats — Firestore-primary via **embed** preferred  
- 🟨 Host Vigil Web in desktop **Browser iframe** (`view.cloud` / auto-open after sign-in → `/embed/auth?embed=1`)  
- 🟨 Auth token bridge: desktop `postMessage` idToken → web `/api/session` (`vigil:auth-handoff`)  
- 🟨 Chat history in embed === Firestore when session cookie set  
- 🟨 Desktop Execute from embed: `vigil:request-execute` → Plan Mode `beginExecute`  
- 🟨 Clear UX entry: “Vigil Cloud (Web)” menu + Account Open button vs local agent chat

