## 7. Continuum behaviors

> **عربي:** قسم — Sync

### Sync
- ✅ Chat + plan writes mirror to Firestore when signed in (desktop push)  
- ✅ Pull chats from cloud → local history (Account + after sign-in)  
- 🟨 Firestore **primary** load path (skip VigilDB-first) — not yet; local still default canvas  
- [ ] Optional local cache warm on launch; invalidate on cloud newer `updatedAt`  
- ✅ Agent coding tools never blocked by chat sync failures (best-effort try/catch; local save first)

> **عربي:** قسم — Plan handoff

### Plan handoff
- 🟨 Approve on web → same Firestore plan; desktop **pulls on open** (`ensureLocalPlanFromCloud` / hydrate)  
- 🟨 **Execute** via embed button → `vigil:request-execute` → openPlan (cloud pull) → beginExecute  
- 🟨 Status mirrored via `vigil:execution-status` + Firestore push; web `PlanLiveStatus` polls API

> **عربي:** قياس الاستهلاك والمحفظة

### Metering
- ✅ Desktop `usageEvents` written when signed in  
- 🟨 Wallet debit / shared balance — desktop debits `users.tokenBalance` on usage; CF idempotency later  
- ✅ Devices registered on login (audit only — unlimited)

> **عربي:** قسم — Billing & identity continuum (see `03-عقد-مشروع-الويب.mdc` §2.3 + §2.4 + §5)

### Billing & identity continuum (see `03-عقد-مشروع-الويب.mdc` §2.3 + §2.4 + §5)
- 🟨 User Web **Pricing → packages → checkout → auto activate** (sandbox + **Kashier Test** adapter)  
- ✅ **Free/trial** starter tokens for a configurable period (signup + seed packages)  
- 🟨 Desktop EXE **opens Web login** → handoff via embed auth bridge (custom URL scheme later)  
- 🟨 **Egypt local rails:** Kashier sessions + signed webhook; set `VIGIL_PUBLIC_URL` + dashboard webhook URL  

